# --- Claude Code ----------------------------------------------------------
# Ignored, except for the repository's skills, which are versioned work: they
# describe the project's own procedures, not a machine's configuration. The
# ".claude/*" form is required — with ".claude/", git does not descend into
# the directory and no negation can re-include a file inside it.
# No trailing slash on the negation, so that a symlinked .claude/skills is
# re-included too. Still ignored: settings.local.json, launch.json, worktrees/.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills

# --- Obsidian -------------------------------------------------------------
.obsidian/
.trash/
